<section id="bbs021" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Screenshot beside text: a working title and a short paragraph on the left, a framed landscape screenshot plate on the right with a surface strip standing in for the window chrome.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="24" vertical-align="center" id="Wf0F-HDGSP"><h2>One view of every scheduled delivery</h2><p>The schedule board shows each standing account, its delivery day and the reserved stock, so a missed delivery or a quantity drift is visible the same morning rather than at the monthly review.</p><p>Account managers update it from the road; operations reads it at the start of each shift.</p></grid-item><grid-item colspan="36" padding="0" cell-style="subtle" id="YNUaYTD9yL"><grid spacing="none" direction="vertical"><grid-item rowspan="6" padding="10pt 14pt" background-color="surface" id="uX5D5FnBKk"><p font-size="sm">schedule.northwind.example</p></grid-item><grid-item rowspan="54" padding="0" id="kAq-mO_K_W"><ai-image prompt="Image in this deck's authored imagery style" background="true" meta='{"width":2048,"height":1152}' /></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>